{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is found, take and process it. Else, if visible, move, scan, and return. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ProcessObject    /> <Action ID = ScanObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
